        "name": "Survive, Resist, Collaborate - a World War 2 Choice-Based Story",
        "steam_appid": 3840090,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Survive, Resist, Collaborate </i></strong> is an immersive, fully narrated interactive fiction game set in the occupied Netherlands during the Second World War. Step into the shoes of <strong>Jan</strong>, a young Dutch civilian whose fate is shaped by your decisions as he navigates the harsh realities of war, resistance, betrayal, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real events, your choices define Jan’s journey. Will you hide from danger or join the armed resistance? Help your neighbors or report them to the enemy? Survive at all costs or sacrifice yourself for others? Each decision leads to a unique outcome, with branching narratives that unfold based on morality, loyalty, and courage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙 <strong>Fully Narrated</strong>: Every scene and choice is voiced with high-quality audio, offering a hands-free experience and emotional storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Branching Narrative Paths</strong>: Dozens of unique storylines and endings shaped by your decisions. No two playthroughs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠<strong>Historically Grounded</strong>: Experience wartime life in occupied Netherlands, based on real events and civilian perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤔 <strong>Meaningful Choices</strong>: Every action—no matter how small—can change Jan’s destiny and those around him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Rich Character Development</strong>: Engage with compelling characters across years of wartime and post-war life. Your relationships evolve with every choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♿ <strong>Accessible for the Vision Impaired</strong>: Designed from the ground up to be fully playable with audio alone—ideal for blind or low-vision players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of war stories, historical fiction, or deep moral dilemmas, <strong><i>Survive, Resist, Collaborate</i></strong> offers a gripping narrative adventure where the weight of war is felt in every decision.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Survive, Resist, Collaborate </i></strong> is an immersive, fully narrated interactive fiction game set in the occupied Netherlands during the Second World War. Step into the shoes of <strong>Jan</strong>, a young Dutch civilian whose fate is shaped by your decisions as he navigates the harsh realities of war, resistance, betrayal, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real events, your choices define Jan’s journey. Will you hide from danger or join the armed resistance? Help your neighbors or report them to the enemy? Survive at all costs or sacrifice yourself for others? Each decision leads to a unique outcome, with branching narratives that unfold based on morality, loyalty, and courage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙 <strong>Fully Narrated</strong>: Every scene and choice is voiced with high-quality audio, offering a hands-free experience and emotional storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Branching Narrative Paths</strong>: Dozens of unique storylines and endings shaped by your decisions. No two playthroughs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟠<strong>Historically Grounded</strong>: Experience wartime life in occupied Netherlands, based on real events and civilian perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤔 <strong>Meaningful Choices</strong>: Every action—no matter how small—can change Jan’s destiny and those around him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Rich Character Development</strong>: Engage with compelling characters across years of wartime and post-war life. Your relationships evolve with every choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♿ <strong>Accessible for the Vision Impaired</strong>: Designed from the ground up to be fully playable with audio alone—ideal for blind or low-vision players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of war stories, historical fiction, or deep moral dilemmas, <strong><i>Survive, Resist, Collaborate</i></strong> offers a gripping narrative adventure where the weight of war is felt in every decision.</p>",
