          "notes": "This game contains mature themes and content related to wartime survival and moral decision-making. Players may encounter depictions of violence, executions, and the emotional consequences of war. The storyline includes scenes that portray the harsh realities of World War II, such as:\r\n\r\nNon-graphic depictions of physical violence and death\r\n\r\nReferences to concentration camps, forced labor, and war crimes\r\n\r\nThemes of betrayal, resistance, collaboration, and moral compromise\r\n\r\nEmotional trauma and psychological distress\r\n\r\nDepictions of famine, illness, and civilian suffering\r\n\r\nImplied war-related executions and suicide (non-graphic)\r\n\r\nOccasional strong language appropriate to historical context\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or sexual assault, and no scenes involving drug abuse. Alcohol consumption may be referenced in passing.\r\n\r\nPlayer discretion is advised. This game is intended for mature audiences and aims to portray the emotional and ethical weight of life under occupation during wartime."
